    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29477" root="عضل" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعْضِلٌ</span></b> , applied to an affair, [<i>Hard, strait,</i> or
<i>difficult;</i> (see its verb, 4, first sentence;)] <i>such
that one cannot find the way to perform it.</i> (S,
O.) See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُضَالٌ</span>, in two places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And see
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَضِّلٌ</span>: ― 
